# adapter_99acres_commercial.py imports normalise_v2 and pii_filter from the sibling
# udupi-properties-2304 directory, and test_adapter_99acres_commercial.py imports the adapter,
# so running either by hand drops a __pycache__/ into this committed artefact directory.
# The repo-root .gitignore's __pycache__ patterns are path-anchored to .claude/scripts/ and
# scripts/geography/, so they do not cover this directory — same reason the 2304 directory
# carries its own copy of this file.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
